{"id":1162,"imdb":"tt0056241","en":"The Miracle Worker","orig":"The Miracle Worker","ar":null,"tag":"An emotional earthquake!","ov":"The true story of the frightening, lonely world of silence and darkness of 7-year-old Helen Keller who, since infancy, has never seen the sky, heard her mother's voice or expressed her innermost feelings. Then Annie Sullivan, a 20-year-old teacher from Boston, arrives. Having just recently regained her own sight, the no-nonsense Annie reaches out to Helen through the power of touch, the only tool they have in common, and leads her bold pupil on a miraculous journey from fear and isolation to happiness and light.","rd":"1962-05-23","rt":106,"g":[18,36],"lang":"en","budget":500000,"revenue":2500000,"companies":[{"n":"Playfilm Productions","logo":null,"c":""}],"countries":["US"],"langs":["English"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"US","d":"1962-05-23"},{"c":"ES","d":"1962-09-19"},{"c":"FR","d":"1962-10-10"},{"c":"MX","d":"1962-10-24"},{"c":"IT","d":"1962-11-07"},{"c":"DK","d":"1962-11-27"},{"c":"DE","d":"1963-02-15"},{"c":"AT","d":"1963-04-26"},{"c":"NL","d":"2007-07-04"}],"dir":["Arthur Penn"],"prod":["Fred Coe"],"wri":["William Gibson"],"mus":["Laurence Rosenthal"],"dop":["Ernesto Caparrós"],"cast":[{"n":"Anne Bancroft","ch":"Annie Sullivan","p":"/ydabiabIsMBe2HsNmx43gBpqzxx.jpg"},{"n":"Patty Duke","ch":"Helen Keller","p":"/kksWwV7ECdJWKc269U2qU6GtBN5.jpg"},{"n":"Victor Jory","ch":"Captain Arthur Keller","p":"/6H3Qr1HcKNEp9p3ZNUqs1YQ1aeW.jpg"},{"n":"Inga Swenson","ch":"Kate Keller","p":"/c09amkuxllrFkiX8mXwrIdcn0H7.jpg"},{"n":"Andrew Prine","ch":"James Keller","p":"/oe0MoG0m2bRap16cG8359azdrUi.jpg"},{"n":"Kathleen Comegys","ch":"Aunt Ev","p":"/3eHDGKUn6hR0EVAwZKyuKAb0vtS.jpg"},{"n":"John Bliss","ch":"Admissions Officer (uncredited)","p":"/q7vlPDur2IJhZa9gHx2uQQlE5dI.jpg"},{"n":"Grant Code","ch":"Doctor (uncredited)","p":null},{"n":"Michele Farr","ch":"Annie at Age 10 (uncredited)","p":null},{"n":"Jack Hollander","ch":"Mr. Anagnos of Perkins Scho